{"product_id":"the-10-percent-entrepreneur","title":"The 10 Percent Entrepreneur","description":"\u003cp\u003eStart something new, develop your career and diversify your skills - without giving up your day jobYou want to launch a business, try something new and make yourself more employable, but you don't want to lose the security of your job. You no longer have to choose. Instead, become a 10% entrepreneur.In The 10% Entrepreneur, Patrick J. McGinnis shows you how to integrate entrepreneurship into your life by investing 10% of your time and, if possible, 10% of your capital into side projects. You will generate more income, discover new opportunities, sharpen your skills - and get the life you've always wanted.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Patrick J. McGinnis\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780241198797\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages:\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45885718691993,"sku":"12RA9780241198797","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/69143215ab8b3_The_10_Percent_Entrepreneur.jpg?v=1762965620","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-10-percent-entrepreneur","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}